  "description": "The national epic of the Meitei people chronicling the legendary love, chivalric trials, and spiritual heroism of orphan youth Khuman Khamba and princess Thoibi of Moirang. Set during the reign of King Chingkhu Telheiba in ancient Moirang, the epic is celebrated in song by Pena balladeers throughout Manipur.",
